## How do you choose a national SEO consultant, company or agency?

Choose a national SEO consultant or agency by asking these five questions before you sign:

1. Who will actually do the work each month and how senior are they?
2. How will they stop location pages becoming doorway pages?
3. Which searches and page groups will they report on from which data source?
4. How will they track enquiries as well as rankings?
5. What happens to the content, profiles and accounts if you leave?

Vague promises of "page one" or guaranteed results are a reason to walk away.

