## Frequently asked questions

### Do I need a separate page for every town I serve?

No. National SEO does not need a page for every town you serve. It needs one only for places with a real branch or a staffed service area and facts specific to it. Pages that only swap the town name risk breaking Google's doorway policy.

### Can you manage Google Business Profiles for franchisees?

Yes. I manage Google Business Profiles for franchisees within a national SEO retainer when I have the right access. I set the standards, check every profile monthly and give franchisees a short checklist for reviews and updates.

### How long does national SEO take?

National SEO usually takes several months to show in national rankings. Technical fixes can show in weeks.

My guide on [how long SEO takes](/blog/how-long-does-seo-take/) explains the stages.

### Where are you based and do you work UK-wide?

Yes. I am based in Reading in Berkshire and run national SEO for businesses anywhere in the UK online.

